         "content": "- Diekelmann et al. (2010) — \"The memory function of sleep\", Nature reviews. Neuroscience (cited 3770).\n- Wilson et al. (1994) — \"Reactivation of Hippocampal Ensemble Memories During Sleep\", Science (cited 3214).\n- Rasch et al. (2013) — \"About Sleep's Role in Memory\", Physiological Reviews (cited 2845).\n- Tononi et al. (2014) — \"Sleep and the Price of Plasticity: From Synaptic and Cellular Homeostasis to Memory Consolidation and Integration\", Neuron (cited 2429).\n- Buzsáki (2015) — \"Hippocampal sharp wave‐ripple: A cognitive biomarker for episodic memory and planning\", Hippocampus (cited 1899).\n- Stickgold (2005) — \"Sleep-dependent memory consolidation\", Nature (cited 1865)."
