         "content": "- Bowen et al. (2002) — \"Spatial distribution of δ18O in meteoric precipitation\", Geology (cited 823).\n- Maher (1998) — \"Magnetic properties of modern soils and Quaternary loessic paleosols: paleoclimatic implications\", Palaeogeography Palaeoclimatology Palaeoecology (cited 768).\n- Cook et al. (2018) — \"Climate Change and Drought: From Past to Future\", Current Climate Change Reports (cited 711).\n- Taylor et al. (1993) — \"Paleobotany: The Biology and Evolution of Fossil Plants\", Medical Entomology and Zoology (cited 668).\n- Peppe et al. (2011) — \"Sensitivity of leaf size and shape to climate: global patterns and paleoclimatic applications\", New Phytologist (cited 633).\n- Prior work (2001) — \"Interhemispheric Climate Linkages\", Elsevier eBooks (cited 562)."
